labelled: 2026-10-05
--- code
export async function claimsSchemeThroughLedgerApi(scheme: PostingScheme): Promise<boolean> {
  return askLedger(scheme, { mode: undefined }).then(answer => answer === 'Supported');
}
--- facts
A ledger that ignores the settlement mode stalls on its first posting, whatever mode the posting names. The scheme is asked with no mode, so the first posting `audit/PostingWarmUp.ts` sends still runs on such a ledger.
